<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Why Is the Sky Blue? | 为什么天空是蓝色的？</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f0f4ff;
    --card: #ffffff;
    --en-bg: #f7faff;
    --cn-bg: #fff8f0;
    --en-border: #b0c4de;
    --cn-border: #f5c67a;
    --en-accent: #3a6ea5;
    --cn-accent: #d4880a;
    --text: #2c3e50;
    --text-light: #5a6a7a;
    --formula-bg: #f4f6fa;
    --radius: 10px;
    --shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, "Noto Sans SC", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.75;
    padding: 0;
  }

  /* ── Header ── */
  header {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 48px 24px 28px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4a90d9 0%, #7bc0f0 50%, #f7c948 100%);
    color: #fff;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
  }
  header h1 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .5px; }
  header p  { font-size: 1.05rem; opacity: .9; margin-top: 6px; }

  /* ── Section wrapper ── */
  section {
    max-width: 1300px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 36px 24px 12px;
